        "text": "  - `gs://mybucket/path/to/export.csv`"
      },
      {
        "input_line": 183,
        "text": "- Required external libraries: [google-cloud-storage](https://cloud.google.com/storage/docs/reference/libraries#client-libraries-install-python)."
      },
